  "limits": [
    "No field or wind-tunnel validation. New Howe oracle is an independent Fortran equation implementation, not an OpenFAST model.",
    "Howe assumes attached turbulent low-Mach flat-plate flow; current official BL tables can fail these checks. Synthetic overrides do not establish applicability to the real turbine.",
